    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639480/extras/957971f321e0b17d1738a76f82735db1.poster.avif?t=1753538980\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639480/extras/957971f321e0b17d1738a76f82735db1.webm?t=1753538980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639480/extras/957971f321e0b17d1738a76f82735db1.mp4?t=1753538980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a choice-driven game. With just two options, you can change the course of the story, leading to multiple endings. It offers a rich and immersive narrative experience. The game is visually focused, with choices presented in the form of dialogues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduating from university, you find yourself unemployed and staying at your father's house. One day, your father introduces you to his new wife and her daughter, Ayame. As you go through a difficult time, you try to seduce Ayame with your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this choice-based story, every decision you make will shape your fate with Ayame. Are you ready to dive into this thrilling adventure?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639480/extras/957971f321e0b17d1738a76f82735db1.poster.avif?t=1753538980\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639480/extras/957971f321e0b17d1738a76f82735db1.webm?t=1753538980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639480/extras/957971f321e0b17d1738a76f82735db1.mp4?t=1753538980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a choice-driven game. With just two options, you can change the course of the story, leading to multiple endings. It offers a rich and immersive narrative experience. The game is visually focused, with choices presented in the form of dialogues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduating from university, you find yourself unemployed and staying at your father's house. One day, your father introduces you to his new wife and her daughter, Ayame. As you go through a difficult time, you try to seduce Ayame with your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this choice-based story, every decision you make will shape your fate with Ayame. Are you ready to dive into this thrilling adventure?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
